- 与此同时，哈蒙德已经把车给搞定了。
- Harry...
- Meanwhile, Hammond had met his car.

871
00:50:43,503 --> 00:50:46,591
我还不太习惯这种事儿。
I'm not used to this sort of thing.

872
00:50:47,634 --> 00:50:48,758
你说你会骑马。
You said you could ride.

873
00:50:48,833 --> 00:50:52,263
是啊，不过我在乡间小路上骑个小马驹跑来跑去，
Yeah, but I trot around the country lanes
on a little pony,

874
00:50:52,331 --> 00:50:55,227
- 这可和这事儿不大一样。
- 那只是匹小矮马。
- and this isn't quite the same sort of deal.
- It's only a pony horse.

875
00:50:55,295 --> 00:50:58,157
不是的。他是个叫哈里的猎手。
It's not. He's a hunter called Harry.

876
00:50:58,226 --> 00:51:01,519
理查德，实际上你已经拿到驾照——
Richard, the fact of the matter is,
you passed your driving test -

877
00:51:01,591 --> 00:51:03,419
那就意味着你可以开任何车，对吧？
that qualified you to
drive every car, yeah?

878
00:51:03,489 --> 00:51:06,782
别坐在宾利里摇头说“我根本控制不住它”。
You don't get in a Bentley and go
"Oh, I'll never be able to control it."

879
00:51:06,853 --> 00:51:08,079
所以，直接上车吧。
So, just get on it.

880
00:51:08,153 --> 00:51:10,674
- 这不一样，他是猎手。
- 你会骑马吗？
- It's different, he's a hunter.
- Can you ride a horse?

881
00:51:10,751 --> 00:51:12,443
- 是的。
- 那是马吗？
- Yes.
- Is that a horse?

882
00:51:12,517 --> 00:51:14,175
- 技术上是。
- 那就上去吧。
- Technically, yes.
- Get on it then.

883
00:51:14,249 --> 00:51:16,475
- 需要我扶你一把吗？
- 好的。
- Do you want me to give you a leg up?
- Yes.

884
00:51:16,547 --> 00:51:18,409
谢谢，我得穿上这个。
Thank you,
I've gotta have one of these on.

885
00:51:18,479 --> 00:51:19,875
好的，数到三。
Right, on three.

886
00:51:19,945 --> 00:51:21,069
好的。
Right.

887
00:51:21,144 --> 00:51:23,234
- 我的天啊！
- 抱歉。
- Oh, my God!
- Sorry.

888
00:51:23,310 --> 00:51:26,103
能稍微温柔点吗？
Can you do it a bit less ferociously?

889
00:51:26,174 --> 00:51:27,469
上！
Go!

890
00:51:29,405 --> 00:51:30,995
谢谢。
Thank you.

891
00:51:32,003 --> 00:51:33,627
我有点失衡。
I'm slightly out of balance.

892
00:51:33,702 --> 00:51:35,962
把它塞进去。就在那儿。
Get it in. It's there.

893
00:51:36,034 --> 00:51:38,998
- 哦，太棒了。
- 全国赛就是这样的。
- Oh, that's brilliant.
- That's how they are in the National.

894
00:51:39,065 --> 00:51:41,529
我来调这匹马，你把车准备好，
Why don't I adjust this horse
and you get your car ready,

895
00:51:41,597 --> 00:51:43,993
我们来狩猎，你会被弄死吃掉吗？
and we'll have a hunt,
and you'll get killed and eaten?

896
00:51:45,228 --> 00:51:49,658
其他人把清爽的早餐退了回去，
As the rest of the hunt knocked back
a refreshing breakfast,

897
00:51:49,725 --> 00:51:52,087
我已经勾画出追逐的路线。
I scoped out the route of the chase.

898
00:51:52,156 --> 00:51:55,314
好，我得从现在所在的这里，
OK, I've got to get from here,
where I am now,

899
00:51:55,387 --> 00:51:56,852
跑到这座小山顶上。
to here, on top of this hill.

900
00:51:56,919 --> 00:51:58,975
大约九英里，
It's about nine miles,

901
00:51:59,052 --> 00:52:02,845
据我所见，唯一的麻烦是过这条小溪，
and as far as I can see, the only
real problem is crossing this stream,

902
00:52:02,915 --> 00:52:04,743
我得涉过去。
which I shall ford.

903
00:52:04,814 --> 00:52:11,606
说实话，达西先生骑着他那匹可靠的马——埃沃斯蒂克，根本没戏。
Honestly, Mr. Darcy on his trusty
steed, Evostik, doesn't stand a chance.

904
00:52:11,677 --> 00:52:14,573
我刚刚注意到我的马有点问题。
I've just noticed something about my horse.

905
00:52:14,641 --> 00:52:16,299
它喝了巴西酒。
He's had a Brazilian.

906
00:52:17,339 --> 00:52:19,270
猎犬已经准备好…
The hounds were ready...

907
00:52:19,338 --> 00:52:21,495
马也准备好了，
the horses were ready,

908
00:52:21,570 --> 00:52:25,465
按照《Top Gear》小型日本车狩猎的规则，
and under the rules of Top Gear
small Japanese car hunting,

909
00:52:25,533 --> 00:52:27,861
我获得了两分钟的起跑时间。
I was given a two-minute start.

910
00:52:32,463 --> 00:52:34,087
来吧。
Here we go.

911
00:52:34,161 --> 00:52:36,818
零到六十英里/小时只要12秒。说实话，这并不算快……
Naught to 60 in 12 seconds.
That's not fast, I admit...

912
00:52:37,859 --> 00:52:43,220
但比科林·费尔斯骑马时的速度还快。
but it's faster than Colin Firth's
going to be able to manage... on his horse.

913
00:52:44,520 --> 00:52:48,609
我装作狡猾的狐狸，直奔最近的树林。
Trying to think like a wily fox,
I made straight for the nearest wood.

914
00:52:49,817 --> 00:52:51,578
来呀！
Come on!

915
00:52:52,716 --> 00:52:56,077
真正的绿色越野爱好者可能会嘲笑。
Proper green laning off-road enthusiasts
might mock.

916
00:52:57,446 --> 00:52:59,932
但和他们钟爱的陆虎、悍马不同，
But unlike their beloved Land Rovers
and Humvees,

917
00:53:00,010 --> 00:53:05,701
这辆小巧灵活的Terios不笨拙，像弹簧羔羊一样蹦跳。
the small and agile Terios doesn't lumber,
it boings like a spring lamb.

918
00:53:05,773 --> 00:53:07,203
哎呀！
Oh!

919
00:53:07,272 --> 00:53:10,498
克拉克森的两分钟时间到。
Brer Clarkson's two minutes were up.

920
00:53:16,732 --> 00:53:19,492
如果有人对我们的做法有异议，
If anybody has an objection
to what we're doing here,

921
00:53:19,563 --> 00:53:23,118
请随意  
把你的反对意见自己收着吧。
do please feel free
to keep that objection to yourself.

922
00:53:24,860 --> 00:53:29,118
想掩盖自己的气味，  
我冲向了一片风信子。
Keen to mask my scent,
I made for a patch of hyacinths.

923
00:53:29,956 --> 00:53:31,353
哦！
Oh!

924
00:53:31,422 --> 00:53:35,512
你看，要是那儿有辆悍马，  
我早就卡住了，
You see, if I'd had a Humvee there,
I'd have just got wedged,

925
00:53:35,585 --> 00:53:38,209
现在我得在狗的肚子里翻滚。
and I'd now be in a dog's tummy.

926
00:53:38,284 --> 00:53:39,579
啊呀！
Aargh!

927
00:53:43,214 --> 00:53:45,042
来啊！
Come on!

928
00:53:47,345 --> 00:53:49,741
风信子计策进行得相当顺利——
The hyacinth plan was working well -

929
00:53:49,810 --> 00:53:52,239
连猎犬都被整懵了。
the hounds were completely stumped.

930
00:53:53,607 --> 00:53:57,093
我们在追一只六英尺五的狐狸，  
这家伙应该不难找。
We're hunting a six foot five fox,
he can't be hard to find.

931
00:53:57,171 --> 00:54:00,397
事实上，我连自己都找不到。
Actually, I couldn't even find myself.

932
00:54:00,469 --> 00:54:01,729
我迷路了。
I'd got lost.

933
00:54:01,801 --> 00:54:03,027
地图。
Map.

934
00:54:03,100 --> 00:54:05,292
穿过森林——哪片森林？
Through the wood - which wood?

935
00:54:05,365 --> 00:54:08,557
然后我学到件有意思的事——
Then I learned something interesting -

936
00:54:08,630 --> 00:54:12,116
狐狸尿的味儿比花还刺鼻。
fox pee is more pungent than flowers.

937
00:54:12,194 --> 00:54:16,487
噢，它们正好在我的路线上。  
现在全都在我的路上。
Oh, they're right on my track.
They're now on my track.

938
00:54:22,654 --> 00:54:25,312
加油，小狐狸Terios玩意儿！
Come on little foxy Terios thingy!

939
00:54:26,385 --> 00:54:28,213
哎呀。
Oops.

940
00:54:33,380 --> 00:54:35,005
我们过去了，我出局。
We're through, I'm out.

941
00:54:40,908 --> 00:54:44,497
所有猎人现在全速追我，  
跑得飞快。
All the hunters were now chasing me
at full speed.

942
00:54:44,572 --> 00:54:47,059
好吧，我说的‘全部’…
Well, when I say all...

943
00:54:49,802 --> 00:54:52,959
对，我们现在已经把狩猎给弄丢了。
Right, what we've done, is lost the hunt.

944
00:54:54,399 --> 00:54:57,420
我看到痕迹了。  
是车子的痕迹。
I can see tracks.
There's car tracks.

945
00:54:57,497 --> 00:55:01,256
我用了追踪技巧，根本没用犬只，  
哎呦，一棵树！
I'm using my tracking skills, I'm not even
using the hounds now. Ow, a tree!

946
00:55:03,393 --> 00:55:06,084
主队已经离开森林。
The main pack was now out of the woods.

947
00:55:08,223 --> 00:55:12,084
但在开阔地上，  
那台Terios拉开了大优势。
But, in open ground,
the Terios pulled out a big lead.

948
00:55:15,251 --> 00:55:17,976
天呐，我这儿有点像坦克一样的冲击。  
真是好玩。
Oh, lord, I've got a bit
of a tank slapper here.

949
00:55:25,677 --> 00:55:29,471
各位好，想让我干掉你们吗？  
我是个越野爱好者。
Hello, people, would you like me to
murder you? I'm an off-road enthusiast.

950
00:55:33,739 --> 00:55:36,203
我领先了整整两英里。
I was now ahead by two full miles.

951
00:55:36,271 --> 00:55:37,860
我的天，一个闸门。
Oh, God, a gate.

952
00:55:44,565 --> 00:55:46,529
现在，我得冲出去把它关上。
Now, I've got to get out and shut it.

953
00:55:57,122 --> 00:55:58,451
这进展不顺啊！
That's not gone well!

954
00:55:58,522 --> 00:56:03,644
于是杰里米追上了他的车，  
而我追上了猎物，
So Jeremy had caught up with his car,
and I'd caught up with the hunt,

955
00:56:03,718 --> 00:56:06,807
令人担忧的是，  
它根本不肯在闸门前停下。
which, worryingly,
wasn't stopping for the gate.

956
00:56:06,883 --> 00:56:09,711
我从没跳过，  
从没干过这种事。
I've never jumped.
I've never done that.

957
00:56:12,113 --> 00:56:13,737
现在已经危险地接近威尔士了。
Perilously close to Wales now.

958
00:56:13,812 --> 00:56:15,276
危机四伏。
Perilously close.

959
00:56:15,344 --> 00:56:16,933
哎呀，天呐！
Ooh, Christ!

960
00:56:18,708 --> 00:56:21,037
我的天！我还在继续！
Oh, God! I'm still on!

961
00:56:22,706 --> 00:56:25,727
我只有84马力。
I had 84 horsepower.

962
00:56:25,804 --> 00:56:27,496
他们有十二……
They had twelve...

963
00:56:28,535 --> 00:56:30,227
但他们的像终结者一样，
but theirs were like terminators,

964
00:56:30,300 --> 00:56:33,389
于是我决定
也把大门放弃了。
and so I decided
to give up with the gates as well.

965
00:56:33,931 --> 00:56:36,521
好吧，我们能跳过篱笆吗？
跳过去，跳过去！
OK, can we jump the hedge?
Let's jump it, jump it!

966
00:56:37,962 --> 00:56:40,392
或者直接穿过去，凑合就行。
Or through, that'll do.

967
00:56:41,160 --> 00:56:46,817
我敢打赌，看到这一切，
Top Gear拯救了乡村。
I think there can be no doubt watching this,
that Top Gear has saved the countryside.

968
00:56:46,889 --> 00:56:51,841
没有哪个乡巴佬，无论多么刻薄扭曲，
都可能会对此提出异议，
No rambler, no matter how bitter and twisted
they may be, could possibly object to this,

969
00:56:51,919 --> 00:56:55,871
因为这辆Terios轻得连金盏花都不至于被碾碎。
because the Terios is so light
it's not even breaking the buttercups.

970
00:56:57,115 --> 00:56:58,875
哦，不，不，不，不！
Oh, no, no, no, no!

971
00:57:02,012 --> 00:57:03,670
啊！
Ah!

972
00:57:05,777 --> 00:57:09,002
来吧，Terios小狐狸！
Come on, Terios fox!

973
00:57:10,507 --> 00:57:12,596
看这里！
Check it out!

974
00:57:12,672 --> 00:57:15,034
显然，疯狂的速度根本不管用，
Plainly, reckless speed wasn't working,

975
00:57:15,103 --> 00:57:17,567
于是我只能回归动物的狡猾。
so I went back to animal cunning.

976
00:57:17,635 --> 00:57:20,360
没人能在水里追到我。
Nobody can track me through water.

977
00:57:21,998 --> 00:57:24,190
哦，这水比我想的要深一点。
Oh, that's a bit deeper than I thought.

978
00:57:26,862 --> 00:57:28,724
哦，拜托别这么干！
Oh, please don't do that!

979
00:57:31,293 --> 00:57:33,019
哦，！
Oh, !

980
00:57:34,423 --> 00:57:35,718
该死！
Sake!

981
00:57:36,988 --> 00:57:38,510
拜托，快点。
Please, come on.

982
00:57:38,587 --> 00:57:40,779
求求你，拜托了，求你了！
Please, I beg of you, I beg of you!

983
00:57:42,085 --> 00:57:44,981
我想我们又找到他了。
I think we've found him again.

984
00:57:45,982 --> 00:57:47,537
怎么就不工作呢？
Why won't you work?

985
00:57:47,614 --> 00:57:49,204
为啥我没有低速档？
Why haven't I got low range?

986
00:57:51,379 --> 00:57:55,570
动物的狡猾辜负了我，
于是我打电话求助。
Animal cunning had let me down,
so I tried ringing for help.

987
00:57:55,643 --> 00:57:57,903
下午好，
AA汽车救援服务，
Good afternoon,
AA Motoring Breakdown Services,

988
00:57:57,974 --> 00:58:00,131
这里是Arlene，
有什么可以帮您？
you're speaking to Arlene,
how can I help you?

989
00:58:00,206 --> 00:58:02,364
是的，我要被狗吃掉了。
Yes, I'm going to be eaten by dogs.

990
00:58:02,437 --> 00:58:04,664
而且我是怀孕的女人，
完全是我一个人。
And I'm a pregnant woman
and I'm all on my own.

991
00:58:07,635 --> 00:58:08,691
快点！
Come on!

992
00:58:08,767 --> 00:58:11,231
好在我设法爬了出来。
Happily, I managed to get myself out.

993
00:58:12,265 --> 00:58:13,695
是的！
Yes!

994
00:58:13,763 --> 00:58:15,990
但现在猎物紧追不舍。
But now the hunt was on my tail.

995
00:58:17,494 --> 00:58:21,185
已经没有办法了，
我只好回到疯狂的速度。
There was nothing for it,
I had to go back to reckless speed.

996
00:58:25,055 --> 00:58:26,179
啊！
Ah!

997
00:58:27,487 --> 00:58:29,645
这就是Terios的毛病之一——
This is one of the issues with the Terios -

998
00:58:30,886 --> 00:58:32,612
这车开的有点颠簸。
the ride is a bit bumpy.

999
00:58:38,113 --> 00:58:42,440
只剩三英里就到了，
终于，我冲到小溪边。
With just three miles to go,
finally, I made it to the stream.

1000
00:58:42,510 --> 00:58:43,839
这根本不是小溪！
That's not a stream!

1001
00:58:43,910 --> 00:58:45,806
那根本不算溪流。
That is not a stream.

1002
00:58:51,605 --> 00:58:53,865
天啊，那是塞文河！
Oh, my God, that's the River Severn.

1003
00:58:55,869 --> 00:58:57,992
老天啊！
Christ Almighty!

1004
00:58:59,132 --> 00:59:01,596
我得找座桥过去。
I had to find a bridge.

1005
00:59:01,664 --> 00:59:04,719
狗子们。
Hounds.

1006
00:59:08,126 --> 00:59:12,953
看，那边，没错，是理查德·哈蒙德骑在“快要变成乌胡”的后面。
And there, yes, it's Richard Hammond
bringing up the rear on Soon To Be Uhu.

1007
00:59:16,954 --> 00:59:18,249
是啊。
Yes.

1008
00:59:23,416 --> 00:59:25,278
快点儿，车！
Come on, car!

1009
00:59:30,544 --> 00:59:31,941
四十五。
Forty-five.

1010
00:59:34,342 --> 00:59:35,500
四十五，快点！
Forty-five, come on!

1011
00:59:38,406 --> 00:59:40,098
糟了，路线堵住了。
Oh, no, the route's blocked.

1012
00:59:45,601 --> 00:59:47,327
情况相当危急。
Things were desperate.

1013
00:59:47,400 --> 00:59:50,591
酒吧，那里有女巫。
Pub, There Be Witches.

1014
00:59:50,664 --> 00:59:53,220
天啊，不行不行！
Oh, my God, no, no!

1015
00:59:56,560 --> 00:59:58,287
天啊！
Oh, my God!

1016
01:00:00,691 --> 01:00:01,849
不行！
No!

1017
01:00:03,122 --> 01:00:07,052
就这样，就这样，拜拜，拜拜，孩子们，照顾好你们的妈妈，拜了。
This is it, this is it, goodbye, goodbye,
children, take care of your mother, bye.

1018
01:00:15,548 --> 01:00:21,374
很遗憾，在拍这部片子时，杰里米·克拉克森被狗吃掉了。
Sadly, in the course of making that film,
Jeremy Clarkson was eaten by dogs.

1019
01:00:21,443 --> 01:00:23,906
不管怎么说，我们下周见，
Anyway, we'll be back next week,

1020
01:00:23,974 --> 01:00:26,803
非常感谢观看，届时见，晚安。
Thank you very much for watching.
See you then and good night.

1021
01:00:27,505 --> 01:00:33,911
Corrected by Adithya FRK
Corrected by Adithya FRK

